Package: ipq-wifi-cmcc_rax3000q
Version: 1
Depends: libc
Conflicts: ipq-wifi-8dev_habanero-dvk, ipq-wifi-aruba_ap-303, ipq-wifi-avm_fritzrepeater-1200, ipq-wifi-buffalo_wtr-m2133hp, ipq-wifi-cellc_rtl30vw
Source: package/firmware/ipq-wifi
SourceName: ipq-wifi-cmcc_rax3000q
Section: firmware
SourceDateEpoch: 1787582261
Architecture: arm_cortex-a7_neon-vfpv4
Installed-Size: 14380
Filename: ipq-wifi-cmcc_rax3000q_1_arm_cortex-a7_neon-vfpv4.ipk
Size: 14736
SHA256sum: 70f7cc749834918eb71f5a7559d8c4294673eb902210628e8535a6bd03c5d1dc
Description:  The CMCC RAX3000Q requires board-specific, reference ("cal") data
 that is not yet present in the upstream wireless firmware distribution.
 
 This package supplies board-2.bin file(s) that, in the interim,
 overwrite those supplied by the ath10k-firmware-* packages.
 
 This is package is only necessary for the CMCC RAX3000Q.
 
 Do not install it for any other device!

